{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-molecular-hopf-ring","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:molecular-hopf-ring","kind":"definition","title":"Molecular Hopf ring (closed)","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-threading-link"],"tags":["molecular","hopf-ring","closed-ring","covalent-bond","linking-matrix","circulant","cyclic"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Organic.MolecularHopfRing","text":"molecular-hopf-ring.md","leanSource":"molecular-hopf-ring.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:molecular-hopf-ring\"></a><p>A <strong>molecular Hopf ring</strong> binds all atoms simultaneously via a single threading link.</p>\n<p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{A}_1, \\ldots, \\mathcal{A}_N</code> be atoms arranged in a cycle. A <strong>molecular Hopf ring</strong> of length <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">N</code> is the composite</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\mathcal{R}_N\n  = \n  [\\mathcal{A}_1, \\ldots, \\mathcal{A}_N]\n   \\oplus \n  \\mathcal{T}_N,</code></pre>\n<p>where <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">[\\mathcal{A}_1, \\ldots, \\mathcal{A}_N]</code> denotes the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">N</code> atoms in cyclic arrangement, and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\oplus</code> superposes that arrangement with the threading link <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{T}_N = T(2, N)</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/organic-chemistry/molecular-hopf-ring.md","heading":"Definition","number":"19.2.6","page":"b/def-molecular-hopf-ring","qa":{"counts":{"pass":76,"fail":0,"warn":2,"na":14,"unknown":0,"stale":79},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Organic.MolecularHopfRing","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/organic-chemistry/molecular-hopf-ring.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
